  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nsinA = 3/5\n\ncosB = 4/5\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nsin(A + B) = sinA × cosB + cosA × sinB\n\nsin²θ + cos²θ = 1\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ cosA = √(1 − (3/5)²)\n\n⇒ = √(1 − 9/25)\n\n⇒ = √(16/25)\n\n⇒ = 4/5\n\n⇒ sinB = √(1 − (4/5)²)\n\n⇒ = √(1 − 16/25)\n\n⇒ = √(9/25)\n\n⇒ = 3/5\n\n⇒ sin(A + B) = 3/5 × 4/5 + 4/5 × 3/5\n\n⇒ = 12/25 + 12/25\n\n⇒ = 24/25\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 24/25.**",
